    mary is born on 1955-02-02.
    mary was a citizen of the UK and colonies on 1981-10-29.
    mary had the right of abode in the UK under the Immigration Act 1971 on 1981-10-29.
    british_citizen expects answers ["the question is asked on 1990-01-01 and carl is a british citizen on 1990-01-01", "the question is asked on 1990-01-01 and mary is a british citizen on 1990-01-01"].
    british_citizen_by_descent expects answers ["the question is asked on 1990-01-01 and carl is a british citizen by descent on 1990-01-01"].
    british_citizen_by_annulment_of_renunciation expects answers [].
    entitled_to_register expects answers ["the question is asked on 1990-01-01 and carl is entitled to register as a british citizen on 1990-01-01"] and any unknowns.
    entitled_to_naturalise expects answers [].
    entitled_to_renounce expects answers ["the question is asked on 1990-01-01 and mary is entitled to renounce british citizenship on 1990-01-01"].

